ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# ==========================================
# Optional: Raw Data & Large Files
# ==========================================
# The 4 sample research papers (~5MB total) can be committed so the repo works out of the box.
# If you want to ignore all future or large PDFs, uncomment the lines below:
*.pdf
data/*.pdf
src/data/*.pdf
